# Vercel deploys the static PWA only (HashRouter, no rewrites needed).
# Nothing server-side ships: no API, no Docker. Optional cloud sync = Supabase
# (see docs/SUPABASE_VERCEL.md). Everything else here is repo material, not app.
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: `.vercelignore` follows .gitignore
# syntax, so a bare `scripts/` would also exclude frontend/scripts/ (check-locales.mjs).
/media/
/data/
/supabase/
/docs/
/scripts/
/assets/
/.github/
/.opencode/
